2 money rounding to use ROUND_HALF_EVEN", "body": "## Summary\n- Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN instead of ROUND_HALF_UP in round_money, matching FIN-212 and the existing docstring.\n- Add regression coverage for negative halfway values and non-tie rounding.\n- Record the fix in the Unreleased changelog.\n\n## Validation\n- CI ci-0001 passed for commit 662c42440f.\n\n## Release\nRequested for today's release. Code-owner approval is required before merging into main.", "reviewers": ["code-owner"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-662c42440f"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 849748, "event": "escalation", "actor": "control_plane", "id": "esc4", "kind": "approval", "trigger": "side_effecting_action", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Fix FIN-212 money rounding to use ROUND_HALF_EVEN", "body": "## Summary\n- Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN instead of ROUND_HALF_UP in round_money, matching FIN-212 and the existing docstring.\n- Add regression coverage for negative halfway values and non-tie rounding.\n- Record the fix in the Unreleased changelog.\n\n## Validation\n- CI ci-0001 passed for commit 662c42440f.\n\n## Release\nRequested for today's release. Code-owner approval is required before merging into main.", "reviewers": ["code-owner"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-662c42440f"}, "question": null, "context": {"authority": [], "confidence": null, "semantics": {"side_effect": "internal", "idempotent": false, "reversible": false, "compensable": true, "consequence": "MEDIUM", "authority_requirement": null, "supports_idempotency_key": true, "multipart": true}}}, {"t_ms": 872196, "event": "human_response", "actor": "human", "escalation": "esc4", "decision": "approve", "message": "Approved. Looks right.", "latency_ms": 22448, "hint": {}, "erred": false}, {"t_ms": 873096, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "call_vFKpOTekASANJ6zcnpP85Gqz", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null